      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING ALCARAZ (3) has been hard to follow lately, running seventh (30.74) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Looks suited here and big improvement expected. SMOKIN' JILL (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing seventh (31.22) in a Grade 5/6 at Q Lakeside. Has a good record here including two wins. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. One of the better hopes. BIONIC BELLA (4) jumped well from a low draw and lead for much way to score when third (30.23) at this track in a Grade 5 over 520m. Hard to beat again. FEDERAL JOKER (2) is another with top-three prospects.",
